#. y1:english="Hey, {PA:10}mister?\nWhy did the Jackal say||he was gonna lose tomorrow?\nHmm... {PA:10}Weird.{PA:20}\nHey, bartender.{PA:20}||Do you know anything about this?\nWell... {PA:10}sort of.\nIf you don't mind,{PA:10}||why don't you tell us what's going on?\nAlright...\nWell, {PA:10}Yagisawa-san had a little run-in||with the Yakuza about 6 months ago.\nYakuza?\nYeah. {PA:10}Actually it was my fault.{PA:20}\nAt my previous bar, they were||demanding protection money.\nYagisawa-san was there,\nwhen they came, {PA:10}and||he beat the shit outta them...\nWhat's worse is,||one of them became a vegetable...\nI see... {PA:10}So he's being||blackmailed because of that.\nRight.{PA:10}||I moved the bar and changed the name.\nAnd that's how I ended up here.{PA:10}||But Yagisawa-san's famous, so...\nIt wasn't hard for them to find him.{PA:20}\nSo, {PA:10}that's how he ended up||having to take the dive...\nI see.{PA:10}\nThey set up the fight,{PA:20}||so when the Jackal loses,\nthose gangsters will{PA:10}||win a shitload of cash.\nPoor Jackal...\nYou're a very strong Yakuza too,{PA:10}||and tough as nails, {PA:10}right?\nI know the bookie who||sets up these kind of fights.\nCan you stop him?\n...Who's the bookie?\nA guy named Sawada.{PA:10}||He's low on the Shimano Family ladder.\nThere's a {MS:0}\"{CC:ffc8c8}Mah Jong parlour{CR:00}\"||near the pawn shop.{PA:10}\nThey're running bets for{PA:10}||tomorrow's fight out there.\n...Mister, {PA:10}let's help the Jackal!\nYeah, {PA:20}that's a good idea.||Let's help him.\nReally? {PA:20}Thank you very much!\nI knew you would, mister!{PA:10}||Let's hurry up and go!\nTell the man at the entrance of||the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Mah Jong parlor{CR:00}\"\n\"{CU:ff8080}I need shelter from the rain{CU:ffffff}\".||That's the password.\nGot it.\n\nWhat the hell do I care...\nWell...{PA:10}||Alright then...\nAre you serious, {PA:10}mister?{PA:10}||You don't wanna help him out?\nI got no time{PA:10}||and it's none of my business.\n...Mister, you're so cold.{PA:10}||Please, {PA:10}just think about it!\nNo, little girl...{PA:10}||It's ok. {PA:20}It's our problem.\n...Sorry.\n"
